850576832905657", "id": "2082850576832905657", "text": "TDD is a human discipline.  I don't expect agents to follow it.  I DO expect agents to write unit tests as carefully and comprehensively as a human would, and I ensure that by running coverage, crap, and mutation tests.  \n\nThe reason agents don't have to follow the tight human TDD loop is that they have better and bigger short term memories.", "raw_text": {"text": "TDD is a human discipline.  I don't expect agents to follow it.  I DO expect agents to write unit tests as carefully and comprehensively as a human would, and I ensure that by running coverage, crap, and mutation tests.  \n\nThe reason agents don't have to follow the tight human TDD loop is that they have better and bigger short term memories.", "display_text_range": [0, 343], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 70, "reposts": 80, "likes": 1185, "bookmarks": 421, "quotes": 14, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jul 30 15:27:29 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1785425249, "views": 85401, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/208