ing my own books.  Those people do not understand how agents work and who actually controls them.  You can't tell an agent to be clean.  You have to measure the cleanliness that they produce and have them correct failures of cleanliness.  \n\nWithout such constraints agents are more than happy to build big balls of mud that they can't maintain.", "raw_text": {"text": "People keep on telling me that my message about AI is undercutting my own books.  Those people do not understand how agents work and who actually controls them.  You can't tell an agent to be clean.  You have to measure the cleanliness that they produce and have them correct failures of cleanliness.  \n\nWithout such constraints agents are more than happy to build big balls of mud that they can't maintain.", "display_text_range": [0, 407], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 165, "reposts": 169, "likes": 2011, "bookmarks": 419, "quotes": 33, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Wed Jul 29 16:05:32 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1785341132, "views": 210109, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmarti